WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Step 1. Open the questionnaire list.

1.2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.403
You can create a questionnaire in your facility from a JSON file.

1.3
00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:11.303
In Settings, under Forms, select Questionnaires.

2.1
00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:15.292
Step 2. Start the import. Select Import Questionnaire.

2.2
00:00:15.292 --> 00:00:20.639
Care opens the Import Questionnaire dialog, where you choose the file.

3.1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:26.616
Step 3. Choose the file. Under Please select a JSON file, choose the file.

3.2
00:00:26.616 --> 00:00:33.539
It must be 5 megabytes or smaller. If Care cannot use the file, it shows a message.

4.1
00:00:33.539 --> 00:00:38.662
Step 4. Check the title and the slug. Care fills them in from the file.

4.2
00:00:38.662 --> 00:00:42.986
The slug must not match another questionnaire in your facility.

4.3
00:00:42.986 --> 00:00:45.888
Care also shows the Question count.

5.1
00:00:45.888 --> 00:00:49.632
Step 5. Import the questionnaire. Select Import.

5.2
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:52.835
Care opens the new questionnaire as a Draft.

5.3
00:00:52.835 --> 00:00:57.848
People can fill it in only after you set its status to Active.
